# G8 (graphics): the mouse on the toolbars and the ruler in graphics. Select a word with a double click, then Bold by a click, Italic by holding the
# button (it shows sunk until the release), a tip after a rest and gone when the pointer leaves, the size list, the colour list and the face
# list, a tab stop set, moved and dragged off the ruler, and the first-line marker dragged. Every frame's CRC-32 must equal the host's.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@dclick 45 146
@click 324 62           # Bold
@down 348 62            # Italic held
@move 2 2               # raised while the pointer is off it
@move 348 62
@up 348 62              # runs on release
@move 372 62            # rests on Underline
@wait 12                # its tip shows
@move 300 300           # and goes
@click 280 62           # the size list opens
@move 280 138           # lit
@click 280 138          # chosen
@click 396 62           # the colour list opens when the button is up
@click 440 175
@click 182 62           # the face list
@click 182 120          # Courier New
@click 56 62            # the style list
@click 56 102           # Heading 1
@click 100 88           # a tab stop on the scale
@drag 100 88 160 88     # moved along the ruler
@drag 160 88 160 200    # dragged off: cleared
@drag 0 79 48 79        # the first-line marker
@wheel 2
@wheel -2
f10 down down enter     # File > Save
f10 end enter           # File > Exit
